🚨 Traffic Advisory | Jammu

In view of heavy rains & for public safety:
•4th Bridge & Rotary closed for traffic.
•Avoid travel from Hotel Asia/Satwari Chowk/Bhagwati Nagar towards Major Somnath Chowk & 4th Bridge.
•Road from Atal Chowk (Panjthirthi) → Sidhra Bridge closed due to landslide/shooting stones.

Stay safe, avoid unnecessary travel.

